      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR. MYSTERIO (2) was strongly fancied last time but finished second (20.14), beaten half a length. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. SANDAVE PHOENIX (1) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at Grafton over 450m behind Albert's Return (26.04) in a Mix. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. WHOOP THAT TRICK (8) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Spartan (20.28) in a Grade 6. Has the pace to be prominent. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to be in the finish again. NAUTICAL BLUE (6) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can bounce back.",
